 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-19/match1713701date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">联赛4连败！切尔西0-1曼联先赛落后欧冠区4分 库尼亚制胜B费助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1713701_1776544968_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1713701_1776544968_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1713701_1776544968_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">切尔西0-1曼联遭遇英超4连败，仍积48分，落后欧冠区4分；曼联积分来到58分。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-19/match1713708date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">连续15轮不胜！热刺2-2遭布莱顿补时绝平 西蒙斯传射+世界波</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1713708_1776537753_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x