0%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.61" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1924912_1776549305_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1924912_1776549305_gray.jpeg"> </a></div><p></p><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">瑟尔洛特、阿尔瓦雷斯在点球大战中射失，最终皇家社会以2-2（点球4-3）击败马竞夺得本赛季国王杯冠军。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-19/match1860516date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">终结2连平！十人迈阿密3-2科罗拉多急流 梅西梅开二度+生涯905球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1860516_1776551726_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1860516_1776551726_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1860516_1776551726_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">梅西双响，十人迈阿密国际客场3-2战胜科罗拉多急流，迈阿密终结联赛2连平，已经7轮不败。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-19/match1711030date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">两场不胜！那不勒斯0-2拉齐奥距榜首12分 瓦尼亚扑点难救主</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1711030_1776534048_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1711030_1776534048_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260419/zhanbao_image_1711030_1776534048_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">那不勒斯以0-2不敌拉齐奥。积分榜方面，那不勒斯积66分排在第二，拉齐奥积47分排在第九。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-18/match1718917date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">两连败！多特1-2霍芬海姆 聚勒送点+伤退吉拉西破门难救主</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260418/zhanbao_image_1718917_1776526938_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260418/zhanbao_image_1718917_1776526938_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260418/zhanbao_image_1718917_1776526938_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">多特1-2霍村遭两连败，多特距离榜首拜仁12分，拜仁本轮打平即可夺冠。</span></p><p><strong>【赛后声音】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-19/69e3dd3f3c1ednative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德泽尔比：我看到血性和斗志，球场氛围就像我们在争夺欧冠资格</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260419/202604190346305537.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260419/202604190346305537.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260419/202604190346305537.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">英超第33轮比赛，热刺在主场被布莱顿以2-2的比分战平，在保级道路上再次遭遇挫折。赛后，热刺主帅德泽尔比谈论了相关话题。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-19/69e3e5a34da75native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西蒙斯：被绝平很痛苦但一场胜利就能扭转势头 我踢着想要的位置</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.72" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260419/202604190414406274.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-r